<title>USA: Sylvan Learning sued by testing service.</title>
<headline>Sylvan Learning sued by testing service.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, MD 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sylvan Learning Systems Inc said on Monday that American College Testing Service, a not-for-profit group, filed a lawsuit against the company.</p>
<p>The lawsuit alleges that Sylvan interfered with a pending agreement between American College Testing and the National Association of Securities Dealers, Sylvan said.</p>
<p>Sylvan, which has a long-term testing agreement with the NASD, said the allegations were without merit and that it would contest the lawsuit.</p>
</text>
